{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0c59aa9dc5a833d8f6e","chatId":"7af04914844b44df80f8c60d591bbddf","sessionId":null,"userId":98427,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"E\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"E\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2873,"promptTokens":1757,"completionTokens":305,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:33"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":4,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00590933082222853,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0c59aa9dc5a833d8f6d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482373889,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:33","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0c59aa9dc5a833d8f6d","chatId":"7af04914844b44df80f8c60d591bbddf","sessionId":null,"userId":98427,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n来自美国的路西在访问中国期间，被她的新中国同事凌邀请去与朋友们共进晚餐。点餐时，凌为整张桌子点了菜，直接就还了菜单，没让路西看。食物上桌后，路西看着菜肴，然后说：“我可以吃这个”，选了一个菜吃。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，路西最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 没意识的 & 嫉妒\nB) 没意识的 & 失望\nC) 气恼 & 嫉妒\nD) 伤心 & 嫉妒\nE) 气恼 & 没意识的\nF) 气恼 & 伤心\n\n## 问题 2\n路西为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 凌没有给她自己点餐的机会 & 琳本应该让她为大家点菜\nB) 琳本应该让她为大家点菜 & 她认为琳故意不让她看菜单\nC) 她不喜欢餐厅的食物选择 & 她不知道餐厅的位置\nD) 凌没有给她自己点餐的机会 & 她不喜欢餐厅的食物选择\nE) 她不知道在中国，人们出去吃是分菜的 & 凌没有给她自己点餐的机会\nF) 她不喜欢餐厅的食物选择 & 她认为琳故意不让她看菜单","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00590933082222853,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0c59aa9dc5a833d8f6e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482373886,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:33","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"abafeba21a284cd88a77ee69aea18605"}